// longarm-hub control-plane API (DESIGN §3.3, §5, §6, §7; P1).
//
// Served by longarm-hub on its public port (:7443/tcp, gRPC over TLS; the same
// port also carries the longnet relay's TLS fallback, told apart by ALPN).
// The hub never sits on the data plane: exec, logs, files and PTYs stay
// client <-> worker. Workers are the source of truth for jobs (§2); the hub
// keeps a cache rebuilt from their reports.
//
// Authorization is by the certificate role, like longarmd:
//   Enroll           no certificate needed (the join code is the credential)
//   HubNode.Connect  worker
//   HubNode.Renew    any enrolled role
//   Fleet            client, admin (ListNodes also worker)
//   HubAdmin         admin
//   Fleet.ReportLinks / Links / History  client, admin
